        <ns1:mandatoryOrNot>0...1</ns1:mandatoryOrNot>
        <rdfs:comment>A human-readable narrative that contains a summary of the resource and can be used to represent the content of the resource to a human. The narrative need not encode all the structured data, but is required to contain sufficient detail to make it &quot;clinically safe&quot; for a human to just read the narrative. Resource definitions may define what content should be represented in the narrative to ensure clinical safety.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:label>text</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:seeAlso rdf:resource="file:///content/sample_data/myfiles/MyDrive/0...1"/>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- https://www.nrces.in/ndhm/fhir/r4/StructureDefinition-DiagnosticReportImaging-definitions.html#DiagnosticReport.effective[x] -->

