        <ns1:mandatoryOrNot>0...1</ns1:mandatoryOrNot>
        <rdfs:comment>An integer indicating the number of times, in addition to the original dispense, (aka refills or repeats) that the patient can receive the prescribed medication. Usage Notes: This integer does not include the original order dispense. This means that if an order indicates dispense 30 tablets plus &quot;3 repeats&quot;, then the order can be dispensed a total of 4 times and the patient can receive a total of 120 tablets.  A prescriber may explicitly say that zero refills are permitted after the initial dispense.</rdfs:comment>
